*> NEXT SENTENCE inside an END-IF scope jumps past the END-IF.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  A                  PIC 9.
01  B                  PIC 9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LINE.
    IF A = 1
        NEXT SENTENCE
    ELSE
        MOVE 2 TO B
    END-IF
    DISPLAY "SKIPPED WHEN A = 1"
    IF A = 2 NEXT SENTENCE ELSE MOVE 3 TO B.
    STOP RUN.
